disclosed customer (~8.85% of mcap, SME).","**Trom Industries** — Rs 4.81 cr Gujarat solar-rooftop purchase order from GEDA (~8.72% of mcap, SME).","**Jhaveri Credits & Capital** — receives a Rs 5.79 cr Letter of Intent from GEDA for solar-rooftop supply/maintenance, subject to a security deposit — an LOI, not yet a firm award (~2.9% of mcap).","**Powerica** — receives a Letter of Intent for a 50 MW wind project from GUVNL at Rs 3.51/kWh for 25 years; the PPA is still to be executed, value not stated.","**Larsen & Toubro** — wins two orders classed \"Large\" (Rs 1,000-2,500 cr band each, per L&T's own table): CPWD's Common Central Secretariat buildings in New Delhi and office towers at Amaravati's Quantum Computing Centre.","**Millworks Technologies** — two developmental purchase orders from HAL (HAWK oxygen-valve and MiG-29 sensor assemblies) and a non-binding MoU with TridenTech Engineering for UAV engines; neither states a value.","**Rudrabhishek Enterprises** — has informed the Exchange about Bagging/Receiving of orders/contracts (the filing is a scan; not read).","**Seamec** — enters a charter-hire contract with its promoter HAL Offshore (70.77% holder) for vessel SEAMEC Anant, deployed with ONGC for ~1,225 days; total contract value ~USD 55 mn excl. GST, a related-party transaction at arm's length."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Persistent Systems** — opens a QIP today at a Rs 5,550/share floor price (up to 5% discretionary discount), issue size up to USD 450 mn (~Rs 4,264.61 cr at the filing's own FBIL-rate conversion, ~4.75% of mcap); BRLMs JPMorgan, IIFL Capital and HSBC."],"equity_allotments":["**Affle 3i** — allots a further 12,77,155 shares to promoter Affle Holdings on warrant conversion at Rs 1,115.25 (the balance leg), ~Rs 142.43 cr for today's tranche (our arithmetic); Rs 611.50 cr of the Rs 1,100.38 cr warrant programme is now converted.","**Kerala Ayurveda** — promoter-group lender Katra Holding converts a Rs 12.47 cr unsecured loan into 6,55,000 shares at Rs 190.37 (preferential, non-cash), raising its stake from 4.85% to 9.41% (~6.55% of mcap)."],"m_and_a":["**Eternal** (Zomato) — slump-sells its Going-out India business (Rs 587 cr FY26 revenue, 5.39% of standalone revenue) into WOS Zomato Entertainment; separately swaps its Adonmo stake for a ~4.4% stake in Mygate (valued ~Rs 156 cr) ahead of a proposed Adonmo-Mygate merger.","**PDS Limited** — step-down subsidiary PDS Sourcing (Mauritius) buys the remaining 49% of DBS Lifestyle HK from the Suri family, taking its stake to 100%, completing the consolidation alongside its DBS Lifestyle India divestment (value immaterial).","**Lactose (India)** — fixes 2-Nov-2026 as record date for its NCLT-sanctioned (05-Aug) amalgamation of Vitanosh Ingredients, at a 0.7946:1 share-exchange ratio.","**Kiri Industries** — incorporates wholly owned subsidiary Andemina SpA in Chile to explore mining opportunities (nominal initial capital).","**Marathon Nextgen Realty** — Outcome of Board Meeting held October 21, 2026 (filing not read; carried from the baseline).","**Sagility** — acquires Chirok Health, a US clinical-documentation-improvement and medical-coding provider, its second such deal after CareSeed; consideration not disclosed."],"capex_core":["**SRF** — Rs 600 cr capex via WOS SRF Altech for an aluminium-foil-for-battery facility at Jetapur, MP (12,000 MTPA Phase I; two phases of Rs 300 cr each, by FY29/FY31; ~0.8% of mcap).","**NHPC** — commercial operation of a 250 MW unit of the Subansiri Lower hydro project, per the exchange subject (filing not read)."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 59 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Kheria Autocomp** — H1 FY27 revenue of Rs 72.27 cr, up 31.38% YoY.","**Nureca** — Q2 FY27 revenue up 55% YoY to Rs 58.53 cr, its highest in 20 quarters (operating profit +60%, PAT +12%); H1 revenue Rs 98.87 cr, up 37% YoY, debt-free.","**Bharat Parenterals** — subsidiary Innoxel Lifesciences commences its first US commercial CMO product supply, shifting from licensing-only revenue; no new deal value stated.","**Aye Finance** — per its own headline, highest-ever quarterly profit of Rs 87 cr in Q2 FY27, up 151% YoY (filing not read)."],"distress_risk":["**Jindal Photo** — receives in-principle approval for voluntary delisting of its equity shares from BSE and NSE (filing not read)."],"other_notable":["**Kajaria Ceramics** — denies media speculation of any plan to acquire Asian Granito India.","**Asian Granito India** — a Reg-32 statement of deviation on its 2022 Rs 440.96 cr rights issue: an EPC contract for an Ahmedabad display centre was terminated and re-contracted with a new vendor at a higher cost (Rs 73.80 cr vs a Rs 69 cr advance, of which Rs 68.715 cr was refunded), plus minor working-capital reallocations."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRANSRAIL_21102026082603_TLLPressrelease21102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KALPATPOWR_21102026084653_SEIntimationPR21102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MEGASOFT_21102026100925_Disclosure_Reg_30_-_20261021_signed.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/745586b8-81b9-4a85-b985-8ed404366a2e.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/8c61560a-bd77-4cc1-85c9-1715589cb077.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}